# Test fixtures are DATA, not sources.
#
# test/fixtures/*.expected.dart are golden files — the exact adapter text the
# generator is asserted to emit — so they import `flutter` and `skal_flutter`,
# which this pure-Dart package deliberately does not depend on. Pub analyses
# every .dart file in the archive and reported ~85 "does not have flutter in
# dependencies" warnings against them, drowning the real ones.
#
# Adding those to dev_dependencies to silence it would pull Flutter into a
# package that does not need it. Excluding the goldens from the ARCHIVE costs
# nothing: they are only meaningful next to the tests that read them, and a
# consumer never runs those.
test/fixtures/
